ur videos.\n[1:09:01 - 1:09:10] Speaker 2: And then I think we start with the questions, but also specify what the schedule looks like just so that there's some accountability.\n[1:09:10 - 1:09:11] Speaker 1: 100%.\n[1:09:11 - 1:09:12] Speaker 1: 100%.\n[1:09:12 - 1:09:13] Speaker 1: Awesome.\n[1:09:13 - 1:09:14] Speaker 1: Awesome.\n[1:09:15 - 1:09:16] Speaker 1: Cool.\n[1:09:18 - 1:09:25] Speaker 2: So the challenge I'm having right now, now that they practice in the morning, it's like, wow, I've got a job to do.\n[1:09:25 - 1:09:28] Speaker 2: Nights and weekends aren't as available as they were during the summer.\n[1:09:28 - 1:09:29] Speaker 2: I've got to get these hundred hours.\n[1:09:29 - 1:09:41] Speaker 2: So if I could work on this and help you out without having to be physically present at a scheduled time, that helps me tremendously.\n[1:09:41 - 1:09:41] Speaker 2: So.\n[1:09:41 - 1:09:42] Speaker 1: Yes, absolutely.\n[1:09:42 - 1:09:49] Speaker 2: And this is something I. I would love to do well beyond preceptorship or whatever.\n[1:09:49 - 1:09:49] Speaker 2: So.\n[1:09:50 - 1:09:54] Speaker 2: So when I was at tech, we helped build out the.\n[1:09:54 - 1:09:59] Speaker 2: They had like, a culture development program that I got to be a part of that was super cool.\n[1:09:59 - 1:10:01] Speaker 2: It was after they had the women's basketball thing.\n[1:10:02 - 1:10:03] Speaker 2: Oh, yeah, it was.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"de81dfb4-a415-44af-a53f-3f22223b1fa4","timestamp":"2026-09-15T01:31:08.977Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"[1:07:22 - 1:07:23] Speaker 2: Okay.\n[1:07:23 - 1:07:31] Speaker 2: I think the as exciting as that is, and I'm the same way a lot of times I can get cart before the horse and start building things.\n[1:07:31 - 1:07:37] Speaker 2: I think the conversations are going to guide what the real next step is going to matter.\n[1:07:37 - 1:07:38] Speaker 2: Okay.\n[1:07:38 - 1:07:53] Speaker 2: So we could kind of brainstorm what, what 